{"type":"message","id":"3fb0711b","parentId":"3c751344","timestamp":"2026-05-28T07:31:04.714Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_3bc258eae8df45a8b0360026","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"package com.alibaba.adp.fee.service;\r\n\r\nimport com.alibaba.adp.fee.common.api.AdpFeeCalculateService;\r\nimport com.alibaba.adp.fee.common.model.postfee.req.PostFeeCalculateRequest;\r\nimport com.alibaba.adp.fee.common.model.postfee.res.PostFeeCalculateResponse;\r\nimport com.alibaba.delivery.common.base.AdpInvokeInfo;\r\nimport com.alibaba.delivery.common.constant.AdpSceneEnum;\r\nimport com.alibaba.delivery.common.entity.result.AdpResult;\r\nimport com.alibaba.delivery.framework.entity.model.IdentityContext;\r\nimport com.alibaba.delivery.framework.template.AdpSceneCallback;\r\nimport com.alibaba.delivery.framework.template.AdpSceneTemplate;\r\nimport org.slf4j.Logger;\r\nimport org.slf4j.LoggerFactory;\r\n\r\n/**\r\n * .\r\n *\r\n * @author ī�� lee.jl@alibaba-inc.com\r\n * @version 1.0\r\n * @since 2023/09/04\r\n */\r\npublic class AdpFeeCalculateServiceImpl implements AdpFeeCalculateService {\r\n\r\n    private final Logger logger = LoggerFactory.getLogger(this.getClass());\r\n\r\n    @Override\r\n    public AdpResult<PostFeeCalculateResponse> calculatePostFee(\r\n        PostFeeCalculateRequest request, AdpInvokeInfo invokeInfo) {\r\n        return AdpSceneTemplate.execute(request, invokeInfo, new AdpSceneCallback<PostFeeCalculateResponse>() {\r\n\r\n            @Override\r\n            public String sceneCode() {\r\n                return AdpSceneEnum.SCENE_CALCULATE_POST_FEE.getSceneCode();\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            @Override\r\n            public IdentityContext routeIdentity() {\r\n                return invokeInfo.getBizIdentity();\r\n            }\r\n        }, logger, \"calculatePostFee\");\r\n    }\r\n\r\n}\r\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1779953464714}}
{"type":"message","id":"05bf4a9b","parentId":"3fb0711b","timestamp":"2026-05-28T07:31:20.100Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"用户要求分析业务身份逻辑，我已经收集了足够的信息。让我现在搜索更多的调用方来理解业务身份是如何被构建和传递的。我需要找到：\n\n1. AdpInvokeInfo 和其中的 bizIdentity 是如何被设置的（调用方）\n2. 更多的 AdpSceneCallback 实现\n3. 业务身份识别的具体逻辑\n\n让我搜索调用方代码，看看 bizIdentity 是从哪里来的。\n\n我现在已经收集了足够的信息来理解业务身份逻辑。让我总结分析结果：\n\n**业务身份逻辑架构分析：**\n\n1. **核心数据模型：**\n   - `IdentityContext` - 业务身份上下文，包含 sellerId, adpBizCode, adpSubBizCode\n   - `AdpInvokeInfo` - 调用信息，包含 appName, interfaceSource, bizIdentity\n   - `AdpBizCode` - 业务code常量（WWW, SUPER_MARKET, SMALL_ELEC, INTERNATIONAL, CONSO）\n   - `BizIdentityTypeEnum` - 业务身份类型枚举（目前只有 MT-猫淘大盘）\n\n2. **业务流程框架：**\n   - `AdpSceneTemplate` - 业务场景模板方法，统一执行流程\n   - `AdpSceneCallback` - 业务回调接口，定义 routeIdentity() 方法\n   - `AdpSceneSession` - ThreadLocal session，存储身份上下文\n   - `ProcessEngine` - 流程引擎，根据 sceneCode + identityContext 路由到具体 Process\n   - `Process` - 流程接口，定义 match(IdentityContext) 方法进行业务身份匹配\n\n3. **业务身份流转：**\n   - 外部调用传入 `AdpInvokeInfo`，其中包含 `bizIdentity`（IdentityContext）\n   - `AdpSceneTemplate.execute()` 中，通过 `callback.routeIdentity()` 获取身份上下文\n   - 身份上下文被设置到 `AdpSceneSession` 中\n   - `ProcessEngine.route(sceneCode, identityContext)` 根据业务身份匹配具体流程\n   - 每个 `Process` 实现通过 `match(IdentityContext)` 判断是否处理该身份\n   - `BaseProcess.assembleProcessInput()` 中从 Session 获取身份上下文设置到 ProcessInput\n\n4. **业务身份配置：**\n   - `AdpPlatformBizConfig` - 平台级业务配置，包含大量基于 bizCode 的开关和白名单\n   - `AdpNewLogisticBizConfig` - 新的物流业务配置\n   - `PfBizCodeConfigDiamondService` - 业务身份配置服务（Diamond配置中心）\n\n5. **使用场景：**\n   - 运费计算（AdpFeeCalculateServiceImpl）\n   - 物流时效识别\n   - 业务管控（Control）\n   - AB测试\n   - 订单属性处理\n\n让我继续搜索调用方代码，理解业务身份是如何被构建和传入的。\n","thinkingSignature":""},{"type":"text","text":"现在我已经收集了足够的信息来理解完整的业务身份逻辑。让我再搜索一下调用方如何构建和传入业务身份，以及更多场景的实现。\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_0f467da523e34cb2976b74ec","name":"bash","arguments":{"command":"powershell -Command \"Get-ChildItem -Path 'D: