{"type":"message","id":"c7de65f5","parentId":"86eec914","timestamp":"2026-05-28T07:39:05.909Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Bash commands are returning empty output. This seems to be an environment issue. Let me try using PowerShell commands or try a different approach.\n\nActually, looking at the summary, the user previously said \"尽量使用powershell\" and then complained about git-bash windows popping up. The bash tool is the issue - it's triggering git-bash windows.\n\nLet me try a different approach. Maybe I can use the `read` tool to explore files directly, since I know the project structure.\n\nActually, let me re-read the tools available to me. I have:\n- read: Read file contents\n- bash: Execute bash commands (git-bash on Windows)\n- edit: Make precise file edits\n- write: Create or overwrite files\n\nThe bash tool is the problem - it's using git-bash on Windows which causes popups. The user said \"为什么不使用 gitnexus 了\" - they're asking why I'm not using gitnexus anymore.\n\nI should explain that:\n1. The bash tool is not working properly (empty output)\n2. I don't have direct access to gitnexus MCP tools in my toolset\n3. I need to find an alternative way to use gitnexus\n\nLet me check if there's a way to use gitnexus through the existing tools, or if I need to inform the user about the limitation.\n\nActually, let me try reading the gitnexus CLI skill file to understand how to use it properly.","thinkingSignature":""},{"type":"text","text":"Bash 命令在当前环境中持续返回空输出（无法执行）。我无法通过命令行使用 gitnexus CLI。让我尝试直接读取 gitnexus-cli 技能文件，了解正确的使用方式：\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_795d105de43443ab8b7ed15e","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"C:\\Users\\alilys\\.pi\\agent\\skills\\gitnexus-cli\\SKILL.md"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"ollama","model":"Qwen3.6-Plus-DogFooding","usage":{"input":35525,"output":706,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":36231,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}}