src/main/java/com/alibaba/delivery/logistics/ability/shiptime/strategy/decide/carrier/IDecideCarrierShipTimeStrategy.java:IDecideCarrierShipTimeStrategy\",\n        \"name\": \"IDecideCarrierShipTimeStrategy\",\n        \"filePath\": \"adp-logistics/adp-logistics-biz/src/main/java/com/alibaba/delivery/logistics/ability/shiptime/strategy/decide/carrier/IDecideCarrierShipTimeStrategy.java\"\n      }\n    ]\n  },\n  \"processes\": []\n}\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1779954523337}}
