{"type":"message","id":"7c9bba02","parentId":"956d0b6a","timestamp":"2026-05-28T07:49:05.590Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I have a comprehensive view of the promotion delivery ship timing logic from GitNexus. Let me synthesize all the findings into a complete analysis.\n","thinkingSignature":""},{"type":"text","text":"**GitNexus 完全可用了！** 现在基于 GitNexus 查询结果，下面是大促发货时效的完整分析：\n\n---\n\n## 大促发货时效（Promotion Delivery Ship Timing）分析\n\n### 一、核心架构：策略模式 + 计算器模式\n\n大促发货时效位于 `adp-logistics/adp-logistics-biz` 模块，采用 **计算器-决策-渲染** 三层架构：\n\n```\n┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│  1. 计算器层（Calculator）                                │\n│  PromotionDeliveryShipTimingForwardCalculator            │\n│  → 实现 IShipTimingForwardCalculator 接口                 │\n│  → 负责计算大促发货时效                                    │\n│  → ShipTypeEnum.PROMOTION_DELIVERY_SHIP_TIMING           │\n└────────────────────┬────────────────────────────────────┘\n                     │\n                     ▼\n┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│  2. 决策层（Decide Strategy）                             │\n│  PromotionDeliveryShipTimingDecideStrategy               │\n│  → 实现 IDecideCarrierShipTimeStrategy 接口               │\n│  → 将 ShipTimeDO 转换为 ShipTimeDTO                      │\n└────────────────────┬────────────────────────────────────┘\n                     │\n                     ▼\n┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│  3. 渲染层（Render Strategy）                             │\n│  PromotionDeliveryShipTimingRenderStrategy               │\n│  → 实现 ICarrierShipTimeRenderStrategy 接口              "}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"ollama","model":"Qwen3.6-Plus-DogFooding","usage":{"input":86596,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":86596,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"aborted","timestamp":1779954535768,"responseId":"msg-730